{% comment %}
  Renders a "Try It On" button + upload modal for the current product.

  App EMBED (target: "body"): the merchant switches it on once under Theme
  editor -> App embeds, and Shopify injects it on every page. There is no
  per-template placement, so tryon-widget.js moves the button into the product
  form, directly above the buy buttons, and falls back to a floating button
  when the theme's form can't be found.

  The app BLOCK (tryon-button-block.liquid) is the opt-in alternative for a
  merchant who wants the button at an exact spot. When both are present the
  block wins: tryon-widget.js drops this embed's button. Markup is shared via
  snippets/tryon-widget.liquid.

  Only product pages render anything: `product` is blank everywhere else, and
  so is `widget_key` until install has finished writing the metafield.

  History: this was an embed, then an app block (2026-07-31), then an embed
  again. The block asked merchants to drag it into the right section; the embed
  is one toggle. The cost is that placement is code again — see placeWidget in
  tryon-widget.js, and the `placement_selector` escape hatch below for themes
  it can't place on its own. Embeds also work on vintage (non-JSON) themes.

  Rendered `hidden` on purpose: Liquid has no access to the merchant's
  Postgres activation state (global/selective mode, per-product/collection
  enables, exclusions) — only Shopify's own data and shop metafields, and we
  don't sync per-product metafields. tryon-widget.js calls
  GET .../customer/products/:id/enabled on load and un-hides this only when
  that product is actually enabled, so a disabled product's button never
  flashes into view before disappearing.
{% endcomment %}

{% render 'tryon-widget', settings: block.settings, source: 'embed' %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Try It On",
  "target": "body",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "api_base",
      "label": "API base URL",
      "default": "https://app.aivastra.com"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "promo_text",
      "label": "Promotional text above button"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_text",
      "label": "Button text",
      "default": "Try It On"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Text color",
      "default": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_color",
      "label": "Button color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "border_radius",
      "label": "Border radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "placement_selector",
      "label": "Place button above this element (advanced)",
      "info": "Leave blank to place the button above your Add to cart button automatically. If it lands in the wrong spot on your theme, enter a CSS selector for the element it should sit above."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
